        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2238_8459.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Edel, Veste, Fromme, Ehrenveste, Wyße sonders günstige
<lb n="2"/>liebe Herren guete fründt unnd Nachburen, denselben
<lb n="3"/>sigen mein fründt Nachburlich dienst unnd gruoeß zuvor.
<lb n="4"/>Demnach sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gspans</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußgwandt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hannß</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Juchßen</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Almenßperg</unclear></persName> unnd <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Schlatter von hürsten-
<lb n="6"/>reüti</persName>, minen Ambtsangehörigen, unerörtert haltet, unnd
<lb n="7"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hütt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schlatter</unclear></persName> mich Underthenig gebetten, ich
<lb n="8"/>ime die zuo sellicher sach dienliche zügen, die dann er
<lb n="9"/>alhie gegenwürtig habe, verhören wölte. Alß unnd
<lb n="10"/>hieruff, hab ich selliche by ihren Eiden verhören lassen,
<lb n="11"/>welliche dann bezügt habent wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volget</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erstlich</unclear> so sagt <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geörg</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heberlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ammann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müllibach</unclear></placeName>:
<lb n="13"/>daß er züg zwey mal darby gsin, das <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Schlatter</persName> und
<lb n="14"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Muotter</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einanderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerechnet</unclear>, welliche rechnung
<lb n="15"/>er dann allewegen in sein rechnung Buoch ufgeschriben,
<lb n="16"/>die erste rechnung, so in sein zügen behaußung geschehen,
<lb n="17"/>betreffendt, sig ime zügen nit mehr in wüssen, ob die
<lb n="18"/>sonige 21 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrechnet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> unnd be-
<lb n="19"/>fintd sich auch nit in seinem rechen buoch; aber von der
<lb n="20"/>letsten rechnunge, so zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-261" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Almenßperg</placeName> beschehen, sige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolbewüßt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> er <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Schlatter</persName> alles
<lb n="22"/>verrechnet.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2238_8460.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vetter</unclear> <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kuruß</unclear> ab der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haenhuob</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuget</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">züg</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vngvar</unclear> vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> viertel <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jahren</unclear> mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedachten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear></persName>
<lb n="25"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">personen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehr</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">minß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spittal</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelifert</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">da</unclear> sige <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heberlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Amershoffen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">essen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesagt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wagner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fürstenrüti</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">turn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefraget</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darüber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacob</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geant</unclear>-
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worttet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlogen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschißnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wagner</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachfrage</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">won</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schon</unclear> er in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suoche</unclear>.
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heberlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Amershoffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khundtschafftet</unclear>:
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">minß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spittal</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelifert</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">da</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schlotter</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gassen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bkhomen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befragt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wusse</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spittal</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear> habe er
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> anzeigt, er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darüber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeldt</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geltte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlogen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tropff</unclear>, der <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wagner</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sige</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werd</unclear> er im <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachfaren</unclear>, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kotzer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khoende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sagen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Endtet</unclear> sich damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sagen</unclear>.
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Welliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußsagen</unclear> ich üch hiemit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> sein <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schlotterß</unclear></persName>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschlossen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">überschicken</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechstmeß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">damit</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2238_8461.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="44"/>ruettlichem obhalte beulche wölle. Datum Fraun=
<lb n="45"/>nenfeldt <origDate when="1620-11-09" resp="#ner">den 9. tag Novembris aº 1620</origDate>.
<lb n="46"/>Lux <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Emanuel von Roll</persName> deß
<lb n="47"/>Rhats zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-70" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Uri</placeName>, Landtvogt in
<lb n="48"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Obern unnd Nidern Thurgöw</placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2238_8462.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="49"/>Denen edlen, vesten, frommen, ehrnvesten unnd wysen
<lb n="50"/>herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd rhat der Statt St.
<lb n="51"/>Gallen</orgName>, minen insonders guenstigen lieben herren gueten
<lb n="52"/>fruenden unnd nachbaren.
</p>
